Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.02,0:00:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.32,0:00:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That guest was like, "Make me please pin badge."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.19,0:00:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The same as one you brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.82,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one who asked you to make the pin badge, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of man was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.12,0:00:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Barrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.42,0:00:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Barrel Titor?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Titor?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.09,0:00:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no. Just like barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.63,0:00:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like barrel...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.14,0:00:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The Japanese word for barrel is "taru"!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Taru?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.93,0:00:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A while back, it was in a Rai-Net anime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.06,0:00:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There was this barrel-like monster...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.94,0:00:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a taru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.69,0:00:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,or balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.90,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A man like a barrel or a balloon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Where can we contact him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:00:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.57,0:00:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Private information.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:00:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.58,0:01:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No clues, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But if the man's pin badge is finished,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.59,0:01:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,won't he pick it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He told the man it would take a week to make,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.34,0:01:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,so he left without placing the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.17,0:01:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.80,0:01:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, we have to give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.10,0:01:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.18,0:01:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I wait for the time leap machine's completion tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.15,0:01:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and go back in time...
