Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.46,0:03:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Suzuha?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.79,0:03:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't she just leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.46,0:03:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.63,0:03:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain later!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.05,0:03:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I forgot to ask when the man would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.72,0:03:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.85,0:03:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is that him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was right. The silhouette {\i0}is{\i1} like a barrel or a balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.77,0:03:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.40,0:03:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.57,0:03:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.49,0:03:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you decide to get a fake pin badge?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it suck if she couldn't find her dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.58,0:03:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So I figured I'd show her the badge
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.41,0:03:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and make up a fake Titor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So you wanted to get her excited over nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.92,0:03:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There are two types of lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.92,0:03:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Lies that hurt, and lies that don't—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:04:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think Suzuha would want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.93,0:04:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Amane told me not to tell anyone this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.15,0:04:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,that time machine can only travel backward.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.65,0:04:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you leave, you can't return.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.29,0:04:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.83,0:04:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's something to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.79,0:04:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you brought me a refreshing Coke Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.55,0:04:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.26,0:04:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.05,0:04:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we fix the time machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.68,0:04:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.01,0:04:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You worked this whole time, but that's still amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.64,0:04:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru's the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.10,0:04:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to judge him by his looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.77,0:04:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.36,0:04:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he looks unhealthy and kind of dim...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.86,0:04:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I've changed my mind about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.95,0:05:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can help me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.28,0:05:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Afterward, in the steaming hot confines of the time machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,we can forget our shame and take off our clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.70,0:05:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru and Suzu look good together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.05,0:05:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm saying this because
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.13,0:05:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'll ever have the chance to say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really grateful to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.10,0:05:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,When I first came here, I didn't know anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though this era is much more peaceful,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.56,0:05:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,somehow, to me, it was really scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.57,0:05:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, I have lots of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really happy that I could come here
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and that I could spend time with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.87,0:05:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I really had fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I could be a lab mem,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.79,0:05:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,just for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.71,0:05:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I was happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.96,0:06:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Once you leave, you can't return.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.30,0:06:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe Rintaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.72,0:06:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Change the future—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.47,0:06:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to change the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make it a free world like this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.18,0:06:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe Rintaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.56,0:06:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.19,0:06:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you regret the memories you've made?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.61,0:06:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,When it's time to say goodbye, do you think that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.61,0:06:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,it would've been better if we'd never met?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.87,0:06:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you regret it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.08,0:06:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hashida Itaru told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.71,0:06:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's worried about you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.79,0:06:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.88,0:06:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Changing the future was my father's wish—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And you don't care what'll happen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.47,0:06:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The '70s weren't {\i1}that{\i0} bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make friends like you there, \Nand I'll live freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.32,0:07:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.79,0:07:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's fine, but give it a final check.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.34,0:07:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.05,0:07:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be happier...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.84,0:07:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You just fixed a time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.72,0:07:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,1975...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.81,0:07:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what month and day I should go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.81,0:07:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What would be appropriate? "The Day of Great Luck"?{Taiankichijitsu}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.18,0:07:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Or "the Day of Friends"?{Tomobiki, kanji for friend and pull}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.39,0:07:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Those days are for weddings,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.15,0:07:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,but the Day of Friends might be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.23,0:07:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It could help you make new friends faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Friends? That would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.49,0:07:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,FG204?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.70,0:07:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Suzu...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.83,0:07:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:08:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what my dad named the time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.09,0:08:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,M-My bike?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.39,0:08:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it might fit
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.56,0:08:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,if we removed the tires.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.60,0:08:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You really like it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.73,0:08:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.15,0:08:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.19,0:08:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii figured out who your dad is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's really close by!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.46,0:08:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I always felt
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,that you two made a great pair,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.05,0:08:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and now I know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.05,0:08:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because you're father and daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.89,0:08:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You can't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.89,0:08:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzu's dad is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.85,0:08:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.56,0:09:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.94,0:09:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The idea of this pervert getting married...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.86,0:09:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Isn't that a little mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.07,0:09:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you come to this conclusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.16,0:09:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,First, "barrel" means "taru," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.58,0:09:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Taru... Daru... Thus, Daru!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A pun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.00,0:09:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But Okarin and Barrel Titor
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,were also part of the group that founded the resistance, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.55,0:09:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And in 2010's Akihabara, \Nthey were working on a time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They even knew about Okarin's Reading Signer...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Reading Steiner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.56,0:09:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They knew about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.81,0:09:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That only leaves Daru.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, the most convincing piece of evidence Mayushii found was...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.65,0:09:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The name of the time machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.61,0:09:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,FG204.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.66,0:09:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a future gadget.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.87,0:09:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A future gadget?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's stuff to the right of it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.33,0:10:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,"Future Gadget 204,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.59,0:10:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,second edition, version 2.31"!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.63,0:10:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That naming convention...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.94,0:10:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You should call me "daddy" now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.57,0:10:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.53,0:10:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.54,0:10:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.79,0:10:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to see you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.42,0:10:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...in the time machine you made.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish what you started,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.30,0:10:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,so just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.60,0:11:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.77,0:11:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.03,0:11:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.65,0:11:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,was your mom cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.12,0:11:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a short one with a baby face and big boobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep that a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.46,0:11:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget about Mayushii and the rest of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.09,0:11:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.64,0:11:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find the IBN 5100,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.01,0:11:44.02,op trans,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll get it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.14,0:11:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So please, change the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.11,0:11:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you in 35 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.28,0:11:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it'll only be a few hours for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.30,0:12:19.80,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fs27\frz336.5\frx28\fry358\pos(1131,261)\fax-.05}Part-Time Warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.30,0:12:19.80,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fs34.5\frx14\fry2\fax-0.15\frz339\pos(1060.5,273)}Thank You
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.30,0:12:19.80,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fs34.5\frx20\fry0\frz337.7\fax-0.15\pos(772.5,237)}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzuha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's be sure we see each other again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep working hard until then,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.56,0:12:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,so you try too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.99,0:12:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.96,0:12:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We've received word
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.87,0:12:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,that the satellite that crashed
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.96,0:12:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,into the Akihabara Radio Kaikan has vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.67,0:12:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you think this pin badge \Ncould be our initials?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.43,0:13:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe's "O."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.38,0:13:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hashida's "H."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.43,0:13:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiina's "S."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.64,0:13:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then "M" is for Makise, and "A" is for Amane, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,A lab mem badge, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.35,0:13:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to make one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.98,0:13:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.15,0:13:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Okabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.61,0:13:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The Divergence Meter hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.28,0:13:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Will it change after Amane brings us the IBN 5100 or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.08,0:13:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzuha's 54 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.58,0:13:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My daughter's over 30 years older than I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.58,0:13:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She might be married with grandkids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.13,0:13:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,S-So at this age, I could see my own great-grandkids?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.84,0:13:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You should act grownup like a real great-grandfather!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.57,0:14:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Braun?
Comment: 0,0:14:03.28,0:14:05.57,Sign16A,,0,0,0,,Okabe \NRintaro
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.28,0:14:03.32,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\frz325.045\pos(750,957)\blur0.75}Okabe \NRintaro
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.32,0:14:03.36,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\frz325.045\pos(750,957)\blur0.75}Okabe \NRintaro
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.36,0:14:03.41,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\frz325.045\blur0.75\pos(721.5,979.5)}Okabe \NRintaro
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.41,0:14:03.45,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\frz325.045\blur0.75\pos(721.5,979.5)}Okabe \NRintaro
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.45,0:14:03.49,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\frz325.045\blur0.75\pos(702,1002)}Okabe \NRintaro
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.49,0:14:03.53,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\frz325.045\blur0.75\pos(678,1023)}Okabe \NRintaro
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:03.57,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\frz325.045\blur0.75\pos(678,1023)}Okabe \NRintaro
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.57,0:14:03.61,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\frz325.045\blur0.75\pos(678,1023)}Okabe \NRintaro
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.61,0:14:03.66,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\frz325.045\blur0.75\pos(664.5,1039.5)}Okabe \NRintaro
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.66,0:14:03.70,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\frz325.045\blur0.75\pos(664.5,1039.5)}Okabe \NRintaro
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:03.74,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\frz325.045\blur0.75\pos(660,1044)}Okabe \NRintaro
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.74,0:14:03.78,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\frz325.045\blur0.75\pos(660,1044)}Okabe \NRintaro
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.78,0:14:03.82,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\frz325.045\blur0.75\pos(660,1044)}Okabe \NRintaro
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.82,0:14:05.57,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\frz325.045\blur0.75\pos(660,1044)}Okabe \NRintaro
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.57,0:14:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A letter?
Comment: 0,0:14:07.53,0:14:08.83,Sign16A,,0,0,0,,Hashida \NSuzu
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.53,0:14:08.83,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs66\blur0.75\pos(612,732)\frz322.6}Hashida \NSuzu
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.33,0:14:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hashida Suzu?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.66,0:14:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that from Suzu?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.12,0:14:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.96,0:14:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a letter from someone who once took care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.46,0:14:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,She asked me to give it to you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.13,0:14:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.34,0:14:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She died...
Comment: 0,0:14:27.01,0:14:31.27,Sign16A,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,889)}Hashida \NSuzu
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.01,0:14:31.27,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\b1\frz322.6\fs66\blur0.75\move(612,732,582,747,0,4319)\fad(0,1800)}Hashida \NSuzu
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.31,0:14:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,...ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.35,0:14:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To the great Okabe Rintaro,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's been so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's me, Amane Suzuha.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.65,0:14:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It may have only been a few hours to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.03,0:14:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but right now, it's June 13th, 2000.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.66,0:14:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll get right to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.66,0:14:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.91,0:14:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I failed. I failed. I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:15:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I failed. I failed. I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.00,0:15:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I failed. I failed. I have failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.88,0:15:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I failed. I failed. I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.39,0:15:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I only remembered who I was a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.73,0:15:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For the past 24 years, I'd forgotten myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.15,0:15:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The time travel didn't work correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.11,0:15:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The repair job was imperfect,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.03,0:15:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but it wasn't my dad's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.70,0:15:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.49,0:15:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should've gone directly to 1975.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.79,0:15:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I shouldn't have stopped in 2010.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.79,0:15:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I shouldn't have been so selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.29,0:15:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, the future won't change!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.67,0:15:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I couldn't get an IBN 5100.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.01,0:15:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.01,0:15:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.23,0:16:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why have I even lived this long?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.77,0:16:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I forgot my duty and squandered my life doing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.74,0:16:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Forgive me! Forgive me! Forgive me! Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.86,0:16:09.87,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\an2\be3\fs60\t(500,2127,\fscy125\fscx125)\frz346\move(1471.5,507,1951.5,519,500,2127)}Part-Time Warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.86,0:16:09.87,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\be3\an2\t(500,2127,\fscy125\fscx125)\move(1203,555,1623,579,500,2127)\frz345.4}Thank You
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.86,0:16:09.87,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\be3\an2\t(500,2127,\fscy125\fscx125)\move(687,612,954,654,500,2127)\frz346.3}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.03,0:16:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okabe Rintaro, when I tried to go to 1975,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.29,0:16:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}after the time machine forum meeting, \Nyou stopped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.37,0:16:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because of the rain that night, \Nthe time machine broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.59,0:16:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you can go back in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I ask that you not stop me back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.05,0:16:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My life...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.14,0:16:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...was wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.53,0:16:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Braun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.28,0:16:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.32,0:16:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You look down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.41,0:16:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me how Hashida Suzu died.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.83,0:17:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.83,0:17:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to know how she died!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how it happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.59,0:17:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.84,0:17:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't seem like simple curiosity,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.68,0:17:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,so what's your relationship to Suzu?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.39,0:17:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,An old acquaintance...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.02,0:17:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Very old.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.27,0:17:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still remember
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.65,0:17:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,our time together very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.74,0:17:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't want to say it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.57,0:17:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It was suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.49,0:17:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She hanged herself in her home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,In the year before she died,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.87,0:17:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,she became mentally unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.21,0:17:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But up until then,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.13,0:17:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,she was a cheerful, kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.85,0:18:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.94,0:18:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The time machine broke because
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.07,0:18:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I stopped her back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.95,0:18:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'd never sent that D-Mail,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.11,0:18:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,she would've gone to 1975 right then!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.04,0:18:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.33,0:18:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Okabe, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.37,0:18:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At this rate, Mayuri's going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.26,0:18:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, are you sending a D-Mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.80,0:18:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do that, all of this will disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.64,0:18:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All the time we remember spending
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,with Suzu will have never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.39,0:18:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.85,0:18:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So please, change the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.32,0:18:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.24,0:19:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Okabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.21,0:19:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hashida Suzu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.13,0:19:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't heard that name in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.09,0:19:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.59,0:19:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.88,0:19:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, is she still...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.47,0:19:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's been ten years...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.64,0:19:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She really looked after me for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.35,0:19:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I would've liked to have seen her at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.19,0:19:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she really commit suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.19,0:19:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,She died of an illness!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.53,0:19:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I live in her house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.95,0:19:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That bike...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she really loved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.83,0:19:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't throw it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.42,0:19:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So for ten years, I've kept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.05,0:19:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, she and I were neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.22,0:19:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.55,0:19:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,my house burned down in a fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.39,0:20:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.22,0:20:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and she let me stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Was she alone that whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.44,0:20:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She never married...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.06,0:20:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,She was a little strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.28,0:20:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Once, I asked her
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,why she did all this for someone with no relationship to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.70,0:20:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She just laughed and said,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.29,0:20:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,"Everyone gets help
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.66,0:20:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,from someone else at some point in their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.50,0:20:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So someday, you should help someone too."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.79,0:20:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.13,0:20:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,One second...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.34,0:20:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzu had this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.47,0:20:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what the number means?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.51,0:20:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She was always looking at it from her hospital bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.39,0:20:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She would say "Is this the number before it changes or after?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.31,0:20:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,"Did I manage to change it?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.48,0:20:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever that meant, it bothered her to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.91,0:21:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The divergence number changed,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.08,0:21:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but it hasn't gone past 1%.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.46,0:21:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The train for the outer line will arrive shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.25,0:21:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Please stand behind the yellow line.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.46,0:21:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Yamanote Line is working at this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.63,0:21:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.76,0:21:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.98,0:21:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.11,0:21:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.07,0:21:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.62,0:21:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mayushii's phone rang. Was that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She was having a nice nap, so I didn't wake her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.47,0:22:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Suzuha... did the world change?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.64,0:22:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Has Mayuri been saved?
